<title>USA: Spotsylvania Cty, Va., won by Davenport.</title>
<headline>Spotsylvania Cty, Va., won by Davenport.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Davenport &amp; Co. said it won $22.225 million of Spotsylvania Cty, Va., general obligation school bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 5.3576 percent.</p>
